## Imported from GitHub
Issue #47 (https://github.com/CIRED/cired.digital/issues/47), opened 2025-05-23 by MinhHaDuong, last updated 2025-06-18; labels: none. Migrated 2026-11-01 when tickets/ became the tracker; the issue was closed with a pointer here.

## Original description
We need to be able to score the performance of replies for a given set of prompt, model and documents.
This entails 
- having a list of test questions. 
- a definition of what is a good answer, a quality checklist helps
- an evaluator
